02:00:53.668690+00:00\", \"managed_asset\": {\"sha256\": \"bb93e7861366a01070db15af6179a3cbd6e160e2dfafd2d82d351a8a448b009d\", \"byte_size\": 32793, \"relative_path\": \"raw/public-import/bb93e7861366a01070db15af6179a3cbd6e160e2dfafd2d82d351a8a448b009d/original.html\"}, \"source_sha256\": \"bb93e7861366a01070db15af6179a3cbd6e160e2dfafd2d82d351a8a448b009d\", \"source_locator\": {\"xpath\": \"/html/body/div[2]/div[2]/div[3]/div[2]/div/p[6]\", \"paragraph\": \"候车大厅内，广播循环播放，身份证验证通过时闸机发出轻快的“嘀”声，上千人的通行在高铁发车前13分钟内就能完成。阜阳西站2月24日发送旅客5.75万人次，创建站以来单日客发量新高；春运40天预计发送旅客87万人次，比去年同期增长7.4%。\", \"matched_text\": \"阜阳西站2月24日发送旅客5.75万人次\", \"article_title\": \" 高铁出行添便利（新春走基层） \", \"normalization\": \"万人次×10000；不分摊、不由预计值推算\", \"period_evidence\": \"explicit article reporting date and reviewed publication year\", \"content_selector\": \"//*[@id=\'ozoom\']\", \"statistical_status\": \"published_actual_not_final_audit\", \"publication_date_rule\": \"people\"}, \"original_quality\": \"validated\", \"source_published_at\": \"2026-03-01T00:00:00+08:00\"}','{\"id\": \"33945a89ad60ba02fba7b1a1691e19ea0fc5a71f2669c391cd673bfb53b7f1a4\", \"unit\": \"人次\", \"grain\": \"day\", \"scope\": \"single_station_departures\", \"value\": 57500, \"metric\": \"station_passenger_departures\", \"locator\": \"{\\\"article_title\\\": \\\" \\\\u9ad8\\\\u94c1\\\\u51fa\\\\u884c\\\\u6dfb\\\\u4fbf\\\\u5229\\\\uff08\\\\u65b0\\\\u6625\\\\u8d70\\\\u57fa\\\\u5c42\\\\uff09 \\\", \\\"content_selector\\\": \\\"//*[@id=\'ozoom\']\\\", \\\"xpath\\\": \\\"/html/body/div[2]/div[2]/div[3]/div[2]/div/p[6]\\\", \\\"paragraph\\\": \\\"\\\\u5019\\\\u8f66\\\\u5927\\\\u5385\\\\u5185\\\\uff0c\\\\u5e7f\\\\u64ad\\\\u5faa\\\\u73af\\\\u64ad\\\\u653e\\\\uff0c\\\\u8eab\\\\u4efd\\\\u8bc1\\\\u9a8c\\\\u8bc1\\\\u901a\\\\u8fc7\\\\u65f6\\\\u95f8\\\\u673a\\\\u53d1\\\\u51fa\\\\u8f7b\\\\u5feb\\\\u7684\\\\u201c\\\\u5600\\\\u201d\\\\u58f0\\\\uff0c\\\\u4e0a\\\\u5343\\\\u4eba\\\\u7684\\\\u901a\\\\u884c\\\\u5728\\\\u9ad8\\\\u94c1\\\\u53d1\\\\u8f66\\\\u524d