hnews\", \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-10-18T02:00:55.994609+00:00\", \"managed_asset\": {\"sha256\": \"4abde2424b1ec9b96c2f556fded4d499dac7d7b5e9311e2ff22e86a37c8cebed\", \"byte_size\": 17852, \"relative_path\": \"raw/public-import/4abde2424b1ec9b96c2f556fded4d499dac7d7b5e9311e2ff22e86a37c8cebed/original.html\"}, \"source_sha256\": \"4abde2424b1ec9b96c2f556fded4d499dac7d7b5e9311e2ff22e86a37c8cebed\", \"source_locator\": {\"xpath\": \"/html/body/section/div[2]/founder-content/p[1]\", \"paragraph\": \"今年1月至6月，黄山市的6个高铁站共发送旅客364.2万人次，较去年同期增长28.3%；到达旅客363.2万人次，较去年同期增长29.5%。其中，黄山北站共发送旅客308.8万人次，较去年同期增长30.6%；到达旅客305.6万人次，较去年同期增长31.4%。\", \"matched_text\": \"其中,黄山北站共发送旅客308.8万人次\", \"article_title\": \"轨道上的文旅协奏曲\", \"normalization\": \"万人次×10000；不分摊、不由预计值推算\", \"period_evidence\": \"explicit article reporting date and reviewed publication year\", \"content_selector\": \"//*[contains(concat(\\\" \\\",normalize-space(@class),\\\" \\\"),\\\" content \\\")]\", \"statistical_status\": \"published_actual_not_final_audit\", \"publication_date_rule\": \"ahnews\", \"reported_native_grain\": \"half_year\"}, \"original_quality\": \"validated\", \"source_published_at\": \"2025-07-21T00:00:00+08:00\"}','{\"id\": \"61aa2aee23b780d10bbb9fa6365564788f70a67c67bcf6502b726d6a03732666\", \"unit\": \"人次\", \"grain\": \"cumulative\", \"scope\": \"single_station_departures\", \"value\": 3088000, \"metric\": \"station_passenger_departures\", \"locator\": \"{\\\"article_title\\\": \\\"\\\\u8f68\\\\u9053\\\\u4e0a\\\\u7684\\\\u6587\\\\u65c5\\\\u534f\\\\u594f\\\\u66f2\\\", \\\"content_selector\\\": \\\"//*[contains(concat(\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\",normalize-space(@class),\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\"),\\\\\\\" content \\\\\\\")]\\\", \\\"xpath\\\": \\\"/html/body/section/div[2]/founder-content/p[1]\\\", \\\"paragraph\\\": \\\"\\\\u4eca\\\\u5e741\\\\u6708\\\\u81f36\\\\u6708\\\\uff0c\\\\u9ec4\\\\u5c71\\\\u5e02\\\\u76846\\\\u4e2a\\\\u9ad8\\\\u94c1\\\\u7ad9\\\\u5171\\\\u53d1\\\\u9001\\\\u65c5\\\\u5ba2364.2\\\\u4e07\\\\u4eba\\\\u