its','scenic_reported_visits','holiday','2025-05-01','2025-05-05',111900.0000,'人次','verified',NULL,'https://wlj.luan.gov.cn/zwzx/xqcz/5423086.html','舒城2025年五一报告','2025-05-06 03:31:00.000000','{\"source_id\": \"scenic-wanfohu\", \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-10-18T02:00:40.647488+00:00\", \"managed_asset\": {\"sha256\": \"328124fed743cc34eff1307748dde066f5c3da7bee89f28546eebb7cb54b5c49\", \"byte_size\": 30983, \"relative_path\": \"raw/public-import/328124fed743cc34eff1307748dde066f5c3da7bee89f28546eebb7cb54b5c49/original.html\"}, \"source_sha256\": \"328124fed743cc34eff1307748dde066f5c3da7bee89f28546eebb7cb54b5c49\", \"source_locator\": {\"xpath\": \"/html/body/div/div[3]/div/div[2]/div/div[1]/div[2]/div/p[2]\", \"paragraph\": \"市场活力持续攀升。假日期间，全县累计接待游客80.5万人次，实现旅游综合收入5.06亿元，同比分别增长13.2%和18.9%。重点景区表现亮眼。万佛湖景区假期五天累计接待游客11.19万人次，综合收入1220.36万元，推出科技夜游、非遗展演等多元活动，实现“零事故、零投诉”。万佛山景区接待游客1.85万人次，门票收入268万元，客流与收入同比分别增长12.5%和5%。精品民宿日均入住率达90%以上，归禾里民宿等实现满房；鹏翔生态园、九龙寨等乡村旅游点成为热门打卡地。\", \"matched_text\": \"万佛湖景区假期五天累计接待游客11.19万人次\", \"article_title\": \"舒城“五一”文旅热力值拉满_六安市文化和旅游局（六安市广播电视局、六安市文物局）\", \"normalization\": \"万人次×10000；不分摊、不由预计值推算\", \"period_evidence\": \"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202411/content_6986383.htm\", \"content_selector\": \"//*[@id=\'J_content\']\", \"statistical_status\": \"published_actual_not_final_audit\", \"publication_date_rule\": \"meta\"}, \"original_quality\": \"validated\", \"source_published_at\": \"2025-05-06T11:31:00+08:00\"}','{\"id\": \"44f9441523e981aac2d25ab12773810b03cf497995c915924e8f922a818bcc3b\", \"unit\": \"人次\", \"grain\": \"holiday\", \"scope\": \"scenic_reported_visits\", \"value\": 111900, \"metric\": \"scenic_visits\", \"locator\": \"{\\\"article_title\\\": \\\"\\\\u8212\\\\u57ce\\\\u201c\\\\u4e94\\\\u4e00\\\\u201d\\\\u6587\\\\u65c5\\\\u70ed\\\\u529b\\\\u503c\\\\u62c9\\\\u6ee1_\\\\u516d\\\\u5b89\\\\u5e02\\\\u6587\\\\u5316\\\\u548c\\\\u65c5\\\\u6e38\\\\u5c40\\\\uff08\\\\u516d\\\\u5b89\\\\u5e02\\\\u5e7f\\\\u64ad\\\\u7535\\\\u89c6\\\\u5c40\